{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_092106189ce2baae2f059c1d1d8c7a7f2ead208cc4ff0564bd4828525dd52ab7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b7979b9b0ba6a83ec7369ad94ec3c6dee34174b822b8c3fc746d9b67ac325fdf"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"Compaction writes a versioned summary sidecar validated against the transcript digest before use, keeping completed tool actions as redacted receipts the resumed model is told not to repeat.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0f0a4d28d856fd5f60a1cbf94b9f37c35aa418d7309544e6b14e1abb6f7a9f2c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1eb862671f5d267869e7d4d9b1acc7b96d15aab7f13f6150b749607ea7aabbbd","slc_c9915d386235276d1a1db0150e43f4e39e090740960285e922e1d446339a00de"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"Folder trust is a fail-closed top-level boundary: workspaces are untrusted by default, trust is recorded in a user-owned store a project cannot write, and approval modes are subordinate to it.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_10cbbcb9bcd171f47eccb713cb1e6d14f4a48bbc6c372e46e5f9ad04f6813438","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_19ed5f02ea7ee2a2a2e0b9931d3c1249b4b566ca7f5768ae37b34d5a539dd80b","slc_fdf285652ca60ef89a09ce0bec3fcdcd1aca4f16d6910de581cff5fb64cd04b1"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"Three approval modes exist: default prompts for every mutating tool and denies without a TTY, auto-edit allows write/edit but still prompts for shell, and yolo allows all tools without prompting; read operations never require approval.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1650f165fb9b0cfeed6dce694fccc83d6405b3c18e62fb04fd4f99c09664441a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4fae0e1e0995ec2b47caa8dbf5e1e8709a8198b932e594be6d2681fa2b697b93","slc_876015c999ff92ba6ac74baaaeb8b8cc0d75a3c1b2e615c4a61f0f3ce3e2474b","slc_ff92bf9ebd218600273505f5dc2007e7068a4e87c59ce6610ed60de450ef0705"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors install with npm install, npm run build, and npm link (or invoke node dist/index.js), and are pointed to a first-run guide with a --doctor setup check.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1ad7d991a2c594d6c88b93602ec36c27c33fd6e9870780bd83189f8a1a1ba4d8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a61f404423f06c4688be75bf4a8ef3661f6dd9d19bd4ce70274f468eee02bc33","slc_f70c003835f384420cdf4d89ae0501227e8c3b12ced875d85052526c1cd3b266"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"Trust enforcement is opt-in via --enforce-folder-trust or OMC_ENFORCE_FOLDER_TRUST=1; trust states include trusted, sandbox-enforced, untrusted, and sandbox-unavailable, with mutation denied in the latter two.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3139133b998a08d66cb7a73dd18541ca5d94999b7dd8b7ebf83937e888cd6319","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_49dde9e0d89379e40a2f90e72f4ddfc23b5d0452630527db944a8044f147caf8","slc_6eedaeb620a505465df82f5f86b8be39d2951678e5cacc79f1ba1a3732f46e43","slc_9c4ad1c274dea916f94dea1cc2041a59e87700ed93dcc33a5b1066f02bfa8f56"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"Model configuration resolves from environment variables, an optional trusted workspace .env, and a user settings file, with environment variables taking highest precedence; raw credential fields like model.apiKey are rejected in favor of apiKeyEnv references.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_34a3cebc5dfe9ac5c68ca8b4381dfc5e091aba20b4b4668e2b401fb3b1f12aff","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c24c23c5fe1e9806718aa4362ff63430e9a6562a09db73b66696624bb6f19cfd","slc_e25899975c193abde9918e8ab0a7d78cd7f720252192712b5c69a3c09f1b1334"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"Undo/redo of a completed turn uses content-based checkpoints of only the files the turn's mutating tools touched, restoring pre-images without git reset, and fails closed (exit 2) if files diverged.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_35bd6a4b4f60cca6240187e0adb17f53db053376f5dafd6c239d87900806c56a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_058aa0f4607cb448527385b83182ab0767986a64ab25443fc36596d9c57f4407","slc_3851d13f626aa78c296dfa77d03e6ddf03435ea63096a3ff802e2bfd292c49fb"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"Session-targeted flags (--resume, --session-stats, --tasks, --export-session, --compact, --undo-turn, --redo-turn, --session) accept an exact id or user-owned name and fail closed on ambiguous, corrupt, or unknown values.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4696e232862a3ec2e1c35f3bd6403883afe60ae3aff6bbba54888ad71ad8722e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_008f289bd1e94d164804471e0759a190c08b8cf212318e7ad9ccf10e8eb671d3","slc_40367af21a21ac48abb4652c88d78bf9bf4e322aec81b8369b3be157515d2386","slc_9130dce0d59dfbe476d2ce390c2d26de298e36cdd98ed8224c1f84310620150e"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"Named model profiles can be declared in the user settings file and selected via --profile, --list-profiles, or a defaultProfile, with project-local settings files unable to set profiles.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4ba1e3cf6dbd27990927fa465a83787fa952c28862ba80aabdca071a78446048","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_071e6f930840ce0a984ee27bd05b3de2088b52f7dc8461bb7087012ee8f2f3dc","slc_4fae0e1e0995ec2b47caa8dbf5e1e8709a8198b932e594be6d2681fa2b697b93","slc_ff92bf9ebd218600273505f5dc2007e7068a4e87c59ce6610ed60de450ef0705"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"The project is built with Node.js 22, TypeScript, and ESM, and is installed via npm install/build/link or by running the built dist/index.js directly.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_618bcd1772bc99379ea6217b080ee79415ed9d7a369bc2dd67c9720c1d4867c7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_40e8d0bc095a4b29b0b46742538fd4d72657917705abd9bebd3af25c5259b523","slc_9902c99bf17b73ab67d5f48b214fa1a0ea0377bb54b5bdb63c081060da312585"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"A --delivery-web command serves a loopback-only web delivery board (default port 4317, configurable via --web-port) with /remote-control and /dynamic-workflow pages that expose no credentials or file server.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_66517b652e54c27eea6295c96ccf87f50a372adfe4f36248de6006e56f1574d9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_288bc004a684c42f3e2468bbe5ba3b7deb83ee4caff9af97f399ae3358fb9100"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"Workspace .env loading is gated by folder trust, parsed only for model-config resolution without mutating process.env, and .env.local/.env.production variants and nested .env files are not read.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7c3c9b8f0f7f190911a5d54e28196bb82bf3b6a77681d8df574b077c6a0532dc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a1800aaf31a53dd7f98c09b531e7224d59836390902d137a85103deadfb04306"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"Sessions persist as JSONL under ~/.oh-my-cli/sessions/ with atomic checkpointing; on resume, complete checkpoints are promoted, partial ones discarded, and corrupt ones quarantined rather than deleted.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8dc6e19137cd8c607b258edf77dd7cbfc6973695bf82e1277368dddb4b8d9dfb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0ac0b0b8107fde8e29aa67243dfa8035f555d89af67e28b55c784fc12eb202e8"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"Approval previews and command-policy denials neutralize spoofing Unicode (bidi controls, zero-width characters, look-alike quotes) by replacing each with a visible [U+XXXX] marker to prevent Trojan Source-style disguise.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a44269fa06978844121d5cd4af43abf3b00df667ad3efcf951e187d49654b506","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3f8cb461f10de1fd878b1e8c3cd1c9fbc454fd02310d80d5c7150b0e5fead74b","slc_b568233d8889adfbb97228738168054bfeabef1289c6de1d9115090f0d3cdd0c"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"Side questions answer clarifications against a bounded read-only session snapshot with tool execution and workspace mutation structurally disabled, leaving the source session byte-identical.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_abee26576b49a4b2e3c0b250c106359835e7cda9a9a04ae4f57a0eea4aaab717","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"qwen-code-dev-bot/oh-my-cli@8dce0123dabf snapshot f1d6b1bdd8870a00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_af200da22b48dc1f5d02f2c37a3b8f2f5c686c82ee25f003bcb779bdfce7a285","slc_b36877d8b58fe7d3a7dfe55cb685ab272936d638558e915fe184239cc0cab4e6","slc_ecc96f83226782b08cbd9fd1d47f22c4b047ba25635a8bd9a6ab9f12857f9942"],"source_ids":["src_850d525e7a915e2ab622ed96e9291910"],"text":"With --output json and -p, the CLI emits a versioned newline-delimited JSON event stream (protocol oh-my-cli.headless) with start, assistant, tool_start, tool_result, usage, retry, error, and complete records.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5e96aa5359af4896b06dbbf40889ae81"}
